{{Otheruses|Kyber}}
The '''Kyber Mirrors''',<ref name="Battle of Jedha script">[[The High Republic: The Battle of Jedha (script)|''The High Republic: The Battle of Jedha'' script]]</ref> also known as the '''Reflection caverns''',<ref name="Path of Vengeance">''[[The High Republic: Path of Vengeance]]''</ref> or as the '''reflection mirrors''',<ref name="Battle of Jedha script" /> were an attraction under the [[Dome of Deliverance]]<ref name="TRS">''[[The High Republic: The Rising Storm]]''</ref> in the [[Hall of Reflection]]<ref name="Battle of Jedha">''[[The High Republic: The Battle of Jedha]]''</ref> on [[Jedha]]. They were opened by the [[Priests of Phirma]] only on [[Reflection Day]].<ref name="TRS" /> It was said that the mirrors could show you a [[Force vision|glimpse]] of your future path, to better understand what [[the Force]] might have in store.<ref name="Reflection Day">{{StoryCite|story=Reflection Day (short story)|book=Life Day Treasury}}</ref>

There were three mirrors, which were sheets made of polished [[Kyber crystal|kyber]] that sprouted from the ground like huge spearheads. The mirrors were covered in a dull, speckled patina and shone with an inner glow. All mirrors had a small wooden platform before them for the pilgrims to stand on.<ref name="Reflection Day" />

